<title>USA: St Paul hogs steady/off $0.50 - USDA.</title>
<headline>St Paul hogs steady/off $0.50 - USDA.</headline>
<dateline>ST PAUL 1997-03-27</dateline>
<text>
<p>USDA said barrows and gilts compared with Wednesday, ranged from steady to $0.50 lower. Top $49.50 per cwt.</p>
<p>    US 1-3	  220-250 lbs    49.00-49.50</p>
<p>			250-260 lbs    48.50-49.50</p>
<p>			260-270 lbs    47.50-49.00</p>
<p>    US 2-3	  270-280 lbs    46.50-48.00</p>
<p>    US 2-4	  280-290 lbs    45.50-47.00</p>
<p>    US 3-4	  290-300 lbs    44.50-46.00</p>
<p>Sows - steady/off $1.00. Top $49.00.</p>
<p>    US 1-3	   300-450 lbs    42.50-43.00</p>
<p>			 450-500 lbs    45.00-46.00</p>
<p>			 500-550 lbs    46.00</p>
<p>			 550-700 lbs    48.00-49.00</p>
</text>
